  "sourceTitle": "[Splash Engine] Qwen3.8-27B in native 8-bit at 37–55 tok/s on Apple Silicon: Extending Splash to Q8, 256k context scaling, and the \"Reasoning Cliff\"",
  "sourceBodyHash": "dbf4efe1879f74e8a5b8b01c17dc7585f0661bf24607d979b3fb8ae657164c2c",
